There are two main limitations in the existing literature. First, regarding the results of the proposed methods, in all three studies we observe imbalance in the scoring performance across sleep stages. For example, the \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
